WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.230
<b>Child King</b>

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:04.740
<i>I was born to a father who was a stunt man</i>

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:08.000
<i>and a mother who was an 
unsuccessful actress.</i>

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:11.890
You did great, Haru-kun!

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:14.530
I'll do my best in the next scene, too.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:15.900
Good.

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:22.570
<i>Seeing my mom look so happy 
made acting fun for me.</i>

00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:25.510
<i>It made me want to try 
harder and do a lot more.</i>

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:28.010
<i>But...</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:47.900
Osamake: Romcom Where
The Childhood Friend Won't Lose

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:02.760
I had no idea you were at this school.

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:08.520
Would you tell me why you suddenly 
left show business six years ago?

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:10.910
Why should I have to tell you?

00:02:10.910 --> 00:02:13.700
I decided to be an actor because of you.

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:14.510
Huh?

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:18.160
My dad acted alongside you 
in a historical drama,

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:20.520
and he had the highest praise for you.

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:23.470
But I didn't have any talent.

00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:26.700
I had already given up once, 
but I still wanted to be an actor.

00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:31.280
Then Shirokusa-chan told me 
that you went to this school.

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:33.170
Kachi told you?

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:37.540
I did some digging and found 
out you liked Shirokusa-chan.

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:39.250
I figured I could use that.

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:43.710
In other words, I decided to 
start dating Shirokusa-chan

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:45.770
so that I could humiliate you.

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:48.630
It looks like it worked.

00:02:49.030 --> 00:02:51.390
Why would you do that just to get to me?

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:53.310
Because I hate you.

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:57.410
I wanted victory over you 
in a form that I could see,

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:58.610
that'd be clear as day.

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:00.110
You bastard!

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:03.930
I really wish you wouldn't 
do anything violent.

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:06.080
Though if you want to be expelled,
I won't stop you.

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:09.610
<i>What's his deal? How is 
he a perfect superman?!</i>

00:03:09.610 --> 00:03:12.290
<i>He's just a complete idiot 
who's mad with envy!</i>

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:14.990
<i>Why would Kachi date a guy like this?!</i>

00:03:18.190 --> 00:03:22.460
I'm planning to formally confess to 
Shirokusa-chan at the confession festival.

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:26.070
My agency doesn't want me 
to go public with it yet,

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:29.430
but if I do it at the confession festival,
 they'll have to agree.

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:34.990
And that will be the time 
limit on your first love.

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:39.420
Go ahead and do your best 
to find my weakness.

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:47.530
Hey. You said you wanted to do a play 
for the cultural festival, right?

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:48.720
Huh?

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:50.740
I'll be in it.

00:03:54.570 --> 00:03:57.590
Ah... I see.

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:02.080
Abe's a pro. You'll need a 
good script to beat him.

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:03.380
I know that.

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:07.840
It needs to hook people, make them laugh,
 and leave them speechless.

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:09.530
And who can write...

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:13.110
That's who.

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:14.820
Go on.

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:18.190
N-No, you go!

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:19.350
Hey, Haru!

00:04:19.930 --> 00:04:22.150
Why haven't you checked NINE?

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:25.790
It was my first post since we started dating,
 and I wanted to go together!

00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:26.980
Geh!

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:28.720
No way...

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:31.090
Maru-kun...

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:32.910
Come play with us.

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:39.210
Guilty! Guilty!

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:41.880
Don't cry, Goudo! I'll give you some candy!

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:44.130
Thanks for bailing me out, Kuro.

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:49.630
Hey, perfect.

00:04:49.980 --> 00:04:51.160
Go ask her!

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:52.840
Kachi!

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:55.140
You want something?

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:58.880
Help! Help! Help!

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:02.890
Do you not think it's rude to call 
my name and then turn your back?

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:07.830
I sincerely apologize for 
all kinds of things!

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.090
What... things?

00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:11.470
Huh?

00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:15.150
Nothing. So what do you want?

00:05:15.530 --> 00:05:19.620
Oh... Well, we want to do a play 
for the cultural festival,

00:05:19.620 --> 00:05:24.170
and we were hoping you'd write an amazing 
script that would draw attention.

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:27.720
Suddenly being showered with praise

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:30.410
and asked for favors 
right after I got famous

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:31.630
isn't a great feeling.

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:37.320
But I do want to support people 
who challenge themselves.

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:39.270
I wouldn't mind helping you.

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:40.170
Huh?

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:42.440
You'll be in the play, right?

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:43.760
Oh, yeah.

00:05:44.270 --> 00:05:47.210
Okay. I'll come up with something.

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:47.990
Really?

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:50.200
Depending on what you pay me.

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:52.560
I'll think of something!

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:54.520
Okay.

00:05:55.190 --> 00:05:57.050
Let's exchange NINE info.

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:03.250
I'd like to call you about
the cultural festival.
 Are you free right now?

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:07.220
<b>URRRGH...</b>

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:07.990
Go!

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:18.520
Oh, having curry today?

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:19.420
Yeah.

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:23.420
My little sisters were just saying 
they wanted some of your curry.

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:25.940
I haven't seen them in a while.
 How are they doing?

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:26.910
Good!

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:29.780
<i>Kuro and I live next to each other,</i>

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:31.580
<i>and our parents are good friends.</i>

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:33.780
<i>Since our families spent 
a lot of time together,</i>

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:36.560
<i>her sisters are like my own family, too.</i>

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:39.080
<i>They all have color words in their names,</i>

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:44.290
<i>so local folks call them the four beautiful 
Shida girls, the "Colorful Sisters."</i>

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:48.690
Maybe I should cook something 
every now and then, too.

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:52.780
I'm begging you. Don't.

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:57.190
What? Are you gonna say my tongue 
is like outer space again?

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:58.620
Well, it's true!

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:01.360
Do you know how many times your 
cooking almost killed me?

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:05.020
I'm not even that bad at cooking.

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:08.990
It's such a mess in here again.

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:11.980
Yeah, I spent summer break with my dad.

00:07:12.670 --> 00:07:15.280
Is he crossing the country on foot again?

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:18.630
He's pretty busy doing accident 
re-enactment stunt work.

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:19.720
Huh...

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:23.660
We're both pretty irresponsible, 
so I appreciate you coming by again.

00:07:23.930 --> 00:07:25.180
Thanks.

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:28.640
Yeah, yeah. I bet your 
summer break was crazy.

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:29.170
<b><i>Rock-Paper-Scissors King</i></b>

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:33.090
A photo?

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:36.360
Hey, Haru, who's this kid?

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:40.240
Wow, that's Shiro. 
That brings back memories.

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:41.530
Shiro?

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:44.780
The son of a sponsor on a drama I was in.

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:47.450
We played together once.

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:49.890
I think he said he'd write a story someday,

00:07:49.890 --> 00:07:51.850
and he wanted me to act in it.

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:54.610
I never knew you had a friend like that.

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:00.750
<b>Kachi Shirokusa</b>

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:00.750
<b>Calling</b>

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:00.750
<b>Decline</b>

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:00.750
<b>Answer</b>

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:03.620
Uh, nothing!

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:05.750
I swear, that Tetsuhiko!

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:07.200
Why is he calling me?

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:09.900
I'm gonna go to my room for a minute!

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:11.330
Huh? Why?

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:13.430
Sorry, but could you watch the pot?

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:17.130
Yes, hello?

00:08:17.590 --> 00:08:19.020
<i>Thanks for the message.</i>

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:20.980
Nah, you don't have to thank me.

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:22.240
<i>Do you have time to talk?</i>

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:23.880
Of course!

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:25.640
<i>So about the image for the play—</i>

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:26.560
Haru!

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:28.920
Did you put the vacuum 
cleaner somewhere else?

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:32.920
<i>Ah. So that's it.</i>

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:35.520
No, wait! There's a reason for this!

00:08:33.430 --> 00:08:35.520
The food's gonna get cold!

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:39.660
<i>I'm sorry for calling in the 
middle of your at-home date.</i>

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:42.830
N-N-No! That's not what this is!

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:48.370
<i>I know about your relationship 
with Shida-san.</i>

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:50.330
<i>There's no reason to get so flustered.</i>

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:53.720
Kachi... Is that the kind of person you are?

00:08:53.890 --> 00:08:57.430
You didn't know? It's all your fault.

00:08:57.620 --> 00:08:59.530
Huh? Why?

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:01.140
<i>U-Uh, because...</i>

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:03.770
Haru, I'll be doing the laundry.

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:05.880
Come down when you're done on the phone.

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:09.730
<i>Why don't we talk tomorrow instead?
 Just the two of us.</i>

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:11.040
Just us?!

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:12.200
<i>Yes.</i>

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:14.480
<i>I'll have the library 
prep room ready for us.</i>

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:18.230
<i>I've reserved it for times 
when we want to talk alone.</i>

00:09:19.850 --> 00:09:21.700
<i>Does she mean...</i>

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:27.470
<i>Send me your ideas on the 
image for the play on NINE.</i>

00:09:27.470 --> 00:09:29.550
<i>I might be able to come 
up with a simple plot.</i>

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:33.060
Okay... Thanks. See you tomorrow.

00:09:38.230 --> 00:09:41.010
So it was actually Kachi-san.

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:41.760
Yeah.

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:46.510
Don't you think it's weird that 
she's suddenly approaching you?

00:09:46.510 --> 00:09:49.270
And exchanging NINE contacts in 
front of everyone, too.

00:09:49.590 --> 00:09:51.010
Is it weird?

00:09:51.010 --> 00:09:54.980
She might be working behind the 
scenes with Abe-senpai to trap you.

00:09:54.980 --> 00:09:59.590
And asking Kachi-san, the one you want 
revenge on, for help seems kinda backwards.

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:04.100
Doesn't this feel like 
Abe-senpai's setting a trap?

00:10:04.100 --> 00:10:08.130
If he is, you're a clown happily 
nibbling on the bait he left for you.

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:16.130
How dare he trample all 
over a man's purity?!

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:20.830
I get that acting is the only 
way to beat Abe-senpai,

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:22.380
but can you even act, Haru?

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:27.140
I don't think you should try to act.

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:29.120
It's been ages since you did,

00:10:29.120 --> 00:10:32.730
and there's a lot more bashing 
now than there was then.

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:34.180
You still want to do it?

00:10:34.550 --> 00:10:37.130
Thanks for worrying about me.

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:41.360
But if I don't do anything, 
I think I'll regret it forever.

00:10:41.710 --> 00:10:44.820
So I think this is a good opportunity.

00:10:45.110 --> 00:10:46.900
I'll try practicing tomorrow.

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:51.500
Well, if it doesn't work out, 
acting isn't all you're good for.

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:52.380
I still...

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:54.370
like you.

00:10:56.750 --> 00:10:59.900
Aw, you're embarrassed. How cute.

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:01.940
Well, you should see how red you are!

00:11:01.940 --> 00:11:03.790
I-I'm not red!

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:08.520
No counterattacks! I can't deal with that!

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:10.050
What the hell?

00:11:10.050 --> 00:11:12.400
It's fine for me to egg you on!

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:15.310
But you're not allowed to tease me!

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:18.270
That's some convenient logic.

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:25.160
Hey!

00:11:28.990 --> 00:11:30.520
What about this, then?

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:34.550
J-Just do it. You're gonna kiss me, right?

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:38.130
You don't even have the guts to do that.

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:40.590
And if I said I do?

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:44.320
I'd be happy.

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:46.810
I can't!

00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:48.830
I think you know this,

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:52.020
but no one would think it was 
weird if I got home late.

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:54.640
D-Don't yank the ladder out from under me!

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:56.250
I can't?

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:57.350
You wanna kill me?!

00:11:57.610 --> 00:12:00.390
I got over it a long time ago.

00:12:00.390 --> 00:12:02.570
I'm just moving forward now.

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:05.300
I-I can't! I seriously can't!

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:10.080
Oh, it's Kachi...

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:14.040
I made a list of questions I want to ask.
Use it to think about an image.

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:19.050
Osamake: Romcom Where
The Childhood Friend Won't Lose

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:19.050
<b>\hEpisode 2: 
His and Her and Her Circumstances</b>

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:19.050
<b></b>Haru!

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:22.310
Aiueo... Iueoa...

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:25.250
Ueoai... Eoaiu... Oaiue...

00:12:27.060 --> 00:12:28.270
Swap out!

00:12:28.710 --> 00:12:29.730
Kachi...

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:31.520
Let's do a read-through.

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:32.720
You got it.

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:34.990
I guess I start.

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:38.190
Who has just called my name?

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:41.440
<b>O
Z</b>

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:41.440
<b>S
C
A
R
E
C
R
O
W</b>

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:41.440
There's no need to be scared. Come closer.

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:41.440
<b>Y-Yes, sir.
It's an honor to meet you, sir.
Um, perhaps it's because I have
no brain, but, well...
I struggle to talk to people.</b>

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:41.450
<b>Who has just called my name?
There's no need to be scared.
Come closer.</b>

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:48.100
Y-Yes, sir. It's an honor to meet you, sir.

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:50.930
Um, perhaps it's because I have no brain,

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:54.880
but, well... I struggle to talk to—

00:12:55.630 --> 00:12:57.810
Talk... to...

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:01.090
<b>The Wizard of Oz</b>

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:03.340
You okay?

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:05.250
Haru?

00:13:09.270 --> 00:13:10.390
Haru!

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:15.270
Huh? Kachi?

00:13:15.800 --> 00:13:18.220
Oh, good. You're awake.

00:13:19.210 --> 00:13:22.700
Sorry... We had plans for today.

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:24.240
That's why I waited for you.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:28.350
What's this?

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:32.560
I wrote a bit based on the 
info you sent me last night.

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:35.290
Contents 
Needs an extraordinary concept that will make it the most talked-about event of the cultural festival 

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:33.620
What do you think?

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:36.940
Oh, I get it.

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:40.650
We could use the confession festival, 
since everyone in the school will see it.

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:43.920
Yes. If you want to stand out,
 that's the best way.

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:46.930
You guys will cause a stir 
at the confession festival

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:51.210
and take it over, as if it 
was part of your own play.

00:13:51.210 --> 00:13:52.120
How about it?

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:53.510
Best idea I've heard!

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:55.020
Thanks!

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:01.860
Man, you really are a pro!

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:04.960
Well, that's to be expected 
from one of my plots.

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:08.290
That's all.

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:11.080
You don't get to see more until you pay me.

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:13.370
Oh, right.

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:15.330
I actually don't have much cash on me...

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:19.250
Stop. I don't want to see 
you in that position.

00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:24.630
Kachi, you... know I was 
a child actor, right?

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:25.350
Yes.

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:28.050
Were you actually... supporting me?

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:31.880
Well, yes. I can't deny that.

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:34.420
Oh... So that's why...

00:14:35.090 --> 00:14:38.590
Thanks, but I'm not who I was back then.

00:14:39.150 --> 00:14:41.350
I'm just a high school kid now.

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:43.310
It won't do you much good to expect more.

00:14:43.510 --> 00:14:46.270
But you're preparing to get 
up on the stage again.

00:14:46.630 --> 00:14:49.940
Yeah... Maybe I shouldn't even bother,

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:53.260
but it seems dumb to just 
keep living in obscurity.

00:14:53.260 --> 00:14:56.370
Even if I embarrass myself, I want to 
put all I have into starting over.

00:14:57.310 --> 00:15:01.730
Would you tell me why that happened to you?

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:04.060
That's the payment I want.

00:15:05.970 --> 00:15:09.220
Are you familiar with <i>Child Star</i>,
 the drama I was in?

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:10.230
Of course.

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:14.670
It became a cultural phenomenon 
and launched you to instant fame.

00:15:14.670 --> 00:15:19.390
Yeah, and thanks to that, a continuation 
was made the following year...

00:15:19.840 --> 00:15:25.150
But my mom was happier about being 
in it herself than about me.

00:15:25.810 --> 00:15:30.740
Haru-kun, I get to act in the 
continuation as your mother!

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:31.440
Really?

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:35.540
It's always been my dream to be 
in a drama in this time slot.

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:37.830
It's thanks to you that I got the call.

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:39.240
Thank you so much!

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:40.440
But...

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:44.750
Cut!

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:47.470
Are you okay?

00:15:47.470 --> 00:15:48.750
Quick! Call an ambulance!

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:49.870
Mom?

00:15:49.870 --> 00:15:52.080
She died from a blow to the head.

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:54.180
The car never made contact with her.

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:58.130
It was just a terrible accident that 
happened because she was acting her hardest.

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:00.920
The drama's been canceled.

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:02.350
You should take some time off.

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:03.900
No!

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:07.220
It was Mom's dream to be in that time slot!

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:10.330
That's why she tried so hard 
and ended up like that!

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:17.020
There's no way she'd want this 
drama to fail because of her!

00:16:19.820 --> 00:16:23.000
After that, the drama was 
filmed through to the end,

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:24.790
<b>HOT TOPIC RANKING</b>

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:24.790
<b>20 WEEKS IN A ROW</b>

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:24.790
<b>NUMBER</b>

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.790
and it earned record-breaking ratings.

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:30.890
And then I was forced into 
an indefinite hiatus.

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:36.020
I had no idea.

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:38.200
We were under a gag order.

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:39.680
I'm sorry...

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:41.510
I...

00:16:48.870 --> 00:16:51.210
I got my pay.

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:56.820
Kachi?

00:17:07.510 --> 00:17:09.630
<i>I'm such a fool.</i>

00:17:10.260 --> 00:17:14.040
<i>As a child, I was no good at anything.</i>

00:17:14.040 --> 00:17:15.130
<i>I had no confidence.</i>

00:17:15.820 --> 00:17:17.670
<i>I was bullied because of it,</i>

00:17:17.670 --> 00:17:19.590
<i>so I stopped going to school.</i>

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:38.120
Hi! I'm Maru Sueharu!

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:40.850
A-Are you really him?

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:44.080
Sorry, Maru-kun. My kid's 
a big fan of yours.

00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:47.310
Go on, Shiro. Ask him to play with you.

00:17:48.100 --> 00:17:48.830
But...

00:17:49.260 --> 00:17:50.850
I'm Maru Sueharu.

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:53.120
Let's be friends, Shiro!

00:17:55.310 --> 00:17:57.380
You're amazing, Shiro!

00:17:57.380 --> 00:17:59.260
Look at all these books!

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:06.020
H-Hey, Su-chan...

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:06.870
Hmm?

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:11.890
If I ever write a story, I want 
you to play the star in it.

00:18:11.890 --> 00:18:14.510
Yeah, of course! I'll look forward to it!

00:18:21.150 --> 00:18:23.490
Wait for me, Su-chan.

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:27.150
What do you mean, I can't see him again?!

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:28.070
I'm sorry.

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:30.580
But why? What happened?

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:33.080
Did I do something to make him hate me?

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:36.460
But that's cruel. He promised me...

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:38.220
That's too cruel, Su-chan!

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:41.590
<i>I wanted to get back at him.</i>

00:18:41.590 --> 00:18:45.300
<i>I decided to get stronger, 
prettier, and famous,</i>

00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:47.640
<i>to become the most gorgeous woman ever,</i>

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:50.100
<i>and make him regret that he 
didn't come to see me again.</i>

00:18:51.050 --> 00:18:53.900
<i>But I eventually figured it out.</i>

00:18:54.260 --> 00:18:57.350
<i>That feeling I had was my first love.</i>

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:02.850
<i>I love you, Su-chan. I love you, Su-chan.</i>

00:19:03.430 --> 00:19:07.900
<i>I love you, Su-chan. I love you, Su-chan.</i>

00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:10.500
I want to put all I have into starting over.

00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:15.790
<i>He's just as radiant and 
strong as he was back then.</i>

00:19:16.490 --> 00:19:19.750
<i>I hated him so much, 
but now I'm back to this.</i>

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:25.390
<i>First love is a curse, Su-chan.</i>

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:28.950
<i>My name is Shirokusa.</i>

00:19:28.950 --> 00:19:32.720
<i>I was named after "shirotsumekusa," 
the white clover.</i>

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:40.190
Abe-senpai will sing and dance to 
<i>Child Star</i> at the confession festival.

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:50.660
<b>Confession Festival</b>

00:19:40.190 --> 00:19:43.720
Then you rush the stage and start 
singing and dancing alongside him,

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:46.460
and you completely steal 
the spotlight from him.

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:50.450
Then you ride the wave and 
confess to his girlfriend...

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:54.560
Wait, if you're even better than Abe-senpai,

00:19:54.560 --> 00:19:57.720
does that mean Kachi-san will 
accept your confession?

00:19:57.720 --> 00:19:59.880
That's how it comes across, huh?

00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:02.760
But there's no way she'd do that.

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:04.610
Also, it doesn't make sense.

00:20:04.610 --> 00:20:07.730
How does Kachi-san know 
about Abe-senpai's plan?

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:11.010
This is obviously a trap.

00:20:11.010 --> 00:20:14.450
She's gonna make you do all this 
and then reject you outright.

00:20:15.390 --> 00:20:19.070
It's a plot to kick you as low as you 
can go just when you're riding high.

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:21.550
Nah, she wouldn't do anything that awful.

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:23.000
Are you gonna do this, then?

00:20:25.310 --> 00:20:27.610
I want to, honestly.

00:20:27.610 --> 00:20:30.980
Because Kachi-san might actually 
accept your confession?

00:20:30.980 --> 00:20:33.810
No, it's just because I think it'll be fun.

00:20:33.810 --> 00:20:36.370
It's the perfect thing 
to take Abe down a peg.

00:20:37.260 --> 00:20:41.140
The girl you admire might finally look 
your way. You want to ruin that?

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:44.670
Hey, Kuro... There's something 
I want you to know.

00:20:44.670 --> 00:20:46.410
Nope. I don't wanna hear it.

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:47.610
Listen, I—

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:51.300
Receiving signal! Receiving signal!

00:20:51.300 --> 00:20:52.140
Seriously?

00:20:52.290 --> 00:20:53.540
I don't wanna hear it!

00:20:53.540 --> 00:20:55.430
You're gonna say you still like Kachi-san,

00:20:55.430 --> 00:20:58.200
so we should stop being 
a fake couple, right?

00:20:58.200 --> 00:20:59.100
I don't want that!

00:21:02.390 --> 00:21:03.310
It's not that.

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:07.080
I'm gonna be practicing with 
Tetsuhiko up until the festival,

00:21:07.080 --> 00:21:09.620
so you don't have to come over 
for a while. That's all.

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:10.570
Huh?

00:21:10.570 --> 00:21:13.770
You were opposed to me acting, right?

00:21:14.110 --> 00:21:17.230
Well, I'll probably look pretty 
terrible while I'm practicing,

00:21:17.230 --> 00:21:19.720
so I thought only Tetsuhiko 
should help me out.

00:21:19.720 --> 00:21:21.840
Okay, fine. I believe you.

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:25.760
Don't force yourself to smile.

00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:27.250
Idiot.

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:31.540
Idiot! Idiot! Idiot!

00:21:32.210 --> 00:21:35.020
I think you can probably act just fine.

00:21:35.820 --> 00:21:37.830
As long as you're acting 
for someone else's sake.

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:42.400
That's what it was about when you were a kid 
and your acting made your mom happy, right?

00:21:42.690 --> 00:21:45.240
So if you can decide who 
you want to act for,

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:48.310
I know you can get through this.

00:21:49.980 --> 00:21:51.160
You're right.

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:53.220
Thanks, Kuro.

00:21:53.220 --> 00:21:55.640
You're very welcome.

00:21:58.600 --> 00:22:01.010
Well, ready to start?

00:22:01.010 --> 00:22:01.840
Yeah.

00:22:07.490 --> 00:22:08.540
Haru...
